Your classmate: Have you heard about the new bike-sharing system that the council has introduced downtown?
You: Yes, I read about it yesterday. {{1}}
Your classmate: I think so, but I’m not sure how the registration works.
You: It’s quite straightforward. {{2}}
Your classmate: That sounds convenient. And {{3}}?
Your classmate: It costs only thirty euros a year, and the first half hour of every journey is free.
You: That’s a reasonable price compared with public transport. {{4}}
Your classmate: Probably on Saturday, because I have an important exam on Friday.
You: Excellent idea. And {{5}}?
Your classmate: There are about fifty stations around the city, and one is just outside our school.
You: {{6}}
